{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "05274590a92b42438317acbdf8bc9e97", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "给团队写一封关于交付准时率的通知", "id": "b4778e8acd894524b7dc13c8be4432b1", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:35:30.919571", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "2f805f47ae4248fd942f918a54ea35c8", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:35:30.919571"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "这是一个业务咨询问题，结合上下文直接给出结构化回答。", "id": "bc484b582a43465d8839d07ec423655a", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:35:34.782762", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "各位同事：近期交付准时率有所波动，请各跟单重点关注：1）预测完工与承诺交期偏差>3天的订单须提前预警；2）高风险订单每日站会过一遍；3）发货前 3 天主动同步客户物流信息。本月目标：准时率恢复 95% 以上。", "id": "b7394f3c8c0f4f68a55310e29a56501e", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:35:34.782762", "finished_at": "2026-03-17T09:35:34.782762"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "338349a92d3740f2bd5fae5e67ff255b", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:35:34.782762", "finished_at": "2026-03-17T09:35:34.782762"}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "什么是凝珠机选型的关键参数", "id": "9bacd577df644de59527bd636c9a37ef", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:38:31.778025", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "9529918955034ec7bff773873d010fc2", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:38:31.778025"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "这是一个业务咨询问题，结合上下文直接给出结构化回答。", "id": "f688e086c2a74d96b3e60869809a4fae", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:38:36.240429", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "凝珠液体包装机选型关注：膜材兼容性（PVA/水溶膜）、成型模温控精度（建议±2℃）、灌装精度（±1%）、产能（每分钟袋数）与换产时间。建议提供样品试机后确定型号。", "id": "3fe5d59a121f45d4b7db96f774a44927", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:38:36.240429", "finished_at": "2026-03-17T09:38:36.240429"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "f1f0579e1e66492e87f770e27522a005", "created_at": "2026-03-17T09:38:36.240429", "finished_at": "2026-03-17T09:38:36.240429"}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_con